1
00:00:01,750 --> 00:00:18,000
Hung, Lan and Nam discuss what is most precious.

2
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:25,080
In my opinion, most precious is rice grain.

3
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:34,620
Have you seen anyone who can live without eating? - Hung says.

4
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:54,510
Everyone says: precious as gold. With gold there is money, with money can buy rice grain! - Lan affirms.

5
00:00:57,480 --> 00:01:12,200
Most precious is time. With time can make rice grain, gold silver! - Nam says.

6
00:01:14,170 --> 00:01:23,660
Three friends ask teacher's opinion, teacher says:

7
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:37,750
Rice grain, gold silver, time are still not most precious.

8
00:01:38,460 --> 00:01:50,910
Without workers there would be no rice grain, no gold silver, meaning nothing exists, and time passes in vain.

